    "body": "Thanks, @kels-ng. We should do option (1).\r\n\r\nNew rules are pretty cheap. There are a fair number of rules duplicated in generic and lowered opt, for similar reasons. We don't want to introduce new opt passes without a very compelling need, and moving around existing passes is risky.",
